// Do not edit: change the importer or schemas/versions/manifest.json and regenerate.
// Corrected where the source is wrong (10 patches):
//   - move_minecart: vanilla 26.1 NewMinecartBehavior.MinecartStep writes position and movement as Vec3 (three doubles each) and both rotations as ROTATION_BYTE; the description has floats (net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/minecart/NewMinecartBehavior.java)
//   - custom_click_action: vanilla 26.1 ServerboundCustomClickActionPacket sends the id and then the payload length-prefixed (a VarInt byte count, then an optional tag whose absent form is a lone TAG_End), not a presence boolean (net/minecraft/network/protocol/common/ServerboundCustomClickActionPacket.java)
//   - initialize_world_border: vanilla 26.1 ClientboundInitializeBorderPacket reads/writes lerpTime with readVarLong/writeVarLong (long lerpTime), not VarInt; the description labels speed varint (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundInitializeBorderPacket.java)
//   - world_border_lerp_size: vanilla 26.1 ClientboundSetBorderLerpSizePacket reads/writes the lerp time with readVarLong/writeVarLong (long lerpTime), not VarInt; the description labels speed varint (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundSetBorderLerpSizePacket.java)
//   - multi_block_change: vanilla 26.1 ClientboundSectionBlocksUpdatePacket reads/writes each packed block-change entry with readVarLong/writeVarLong (block-state id << 12 | 12-bit section-relative pos), not VarInt; the description labels the records array varint (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundSectionBlocksUpdatePacket.java)
//   - player_chat chat decoration parameters: vanilla 26.1 ChatTypeDecoration.Parameter ids are SENDER 0, TARGET 1, CONTENT 2; the description rotates them to content 0, sender 1, target 2 (net/minecraft/network/chat/ChatTypeDecoration.java)
//   - player_info: vanilla 26.1 ClientboundPlayerInfoUpdatePacket Action ids are UPDATE_LIST_ORDER 6 and UPDATE_HAT 7, and UPDATE_LISTED carries a boolean; the description swaps the top two flag bits and types listed as varint (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundPlayerInfoUpdatePacket.java)
//   - update_structure_block: vanilla 26.1 ServerboundSetStructureBlockPacket carries seed as a VarLong (readVarLong/writeVarLong, long seed) and flags as a raw bitmask byte (1 ignore_entities, 2 show_air, 4 show_bounding_box, 8 strict); the description has seed varint and a u8 enum mapper that misdecodes combined masks (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ServerboundSetStructureBlockPacket.java)
//   - login/respawn SpawnInfo: vanilla 26.1 CommonPlayerSpawnInfo writes gameType and previousGameType as single bytes (previousGameType -1 for none); the description types previousGamemode as u8, losing the -1 (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/CommonPlayerSpawnInfo.java)
//   - can_place_on/can_break ItemBlockProperty: vanilla 26.1 RangedMatcher holds two Optional<String> bounds; the description has plain strings (net/minecraft/advancements/criterion/StatePropertiesPredicate.java)

